Project lives on anvil (Linux, headless GPU box). Build and run HERE; MacBook is
for viewing images/video and Moonlight only.

AGENT ENTRY: **AGENTS.md** only. How-tos: docs/RUNBOOK.md, docs/BOOTSTRAP.md.
Gates: docs/GATES.md. History: docs/DEVLOG.md. Archive: docs/archive/ (ignore).
Living contracts next to code: c/craster/{PRODUCT,VERIFY,OPEN_DIVERGENCES,SPEC}.md,
c/mc-sim/SPEC.md, c/render-opt/SPEC.md.

ANVIL IS HEADLESS:
- Demo png/mp4: scp to Mac. Never rely on inline image display on anvil.
- Human play: Moonlight/Sunshine :0 or mcwindow. Taping: c/craster/VERIFY.md.
- Agent/trace: Xvfb :1 via bash java/start_vnc_client.sh (VNC 5900, pw redstone).
- One qrl bridge (25575) at a time.

WORK: Craster product + tapes by default. render-opt lab closed. JDK8.
Python: UV only. Goldens from REAL MC only.

GOTCHAS: pkill -9 -f '[G]radleStart' (bracket required). Launch game standalone
(setsid/nohup); never chain kill+launch+poll. Private remote only when oracle-src
is present. No emojis, no em dashes.
